{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37728","headline":"辇下冬暮咏怀 · 郑谷","name":"辇下冬暮咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"永巷闲吟一径蒿，轻肥大笑事风骚。\n烟含紫禁花期近，雪满长安酒价高。\n失路渐惊前计错，逢僧更念此生劳。\n十年春泪催衰飒，羞向清流照鬓毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}